{
  "$comment": [
    "HAND-MAINTAINED source registry. Not generated — do not overwrite from a script.",
    "",
    "RULE: only entries with \"verified\": true are ever rendered on the site.",
    "A source is verified when a human has opened it and confirmed it actually supports",
    "the claim it is attached to. This flag exists specifically to stop unverified or",
    "AI-suggested citations reaching readers, which AGENTS.md and the product brief forbid.",
    "",
    "Candidate references that have been found but NOT yet checked belong in",
    "docs/source-candidates.md, never in this file.",
    "",
    "Everything after the deck entry comes from the card-mapped source audit, whose",
    "references were opened and checked by hand before being brought in here. Which card",
    "cites which of them is src/lib/card-sources.ts; entries below are grouped in card",
    "order so the two files read side by side.",
    "",
    "FIELD-NOTE SOURCES (ids below the card-audit block, cited by src/lib/card-field-notes.ts)",
    "are university Extension, USDA Forest Service and UC IPM references located for the",
    "identification / habitat / lookalike notes. They ship verified:false, so resolveRefs",
    "drops them and NOTHING unverified reaches a reader: the network egress policy in the",
    "environment they were added from blocks these hosts, so nobody has yet opened the page",
    "and confirmed it supports the specific trait it is attached to. Open each URL, check it,",
    "then flip the flag - that is the whole workflow, and it is the one step a machine must",
    "not take on a human's behalf."
  ],
